# Castle Doom's "{T}: Add {C}" is unrestricted (CR 106.6 applies only to the any-color ability). On turn 4 Bot2's Duress is on the stack; Bot1 taps the Castle for {C} and an
# Island for {U} and casts Mana Leak, a nonartifact spell, on it. Bot2 does not pay {3}, so Duress is countered and Bot1 keeps its hand (a Mana Leak paid for with the
# Castle's {C}). Compare the any-color mana, which can't pay for it.

